cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below, and cite the
  PTB-XL dataset and PhysioNet as listed under references.
title: "fedecg-lab: what it costs to learn from ECGs that never leave the hospital"
abstract: >-
  Multi-label classification of 12-lead ECGs (PTB-XL) used to measure, side by
  side, the cost of federated training across simulated hospitals, of
  heterogeneous hospitals, and of differential privacy, with saliency analysis
  checked against a model-randomization test.
